WEBVTT

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.340
OK, koliko znamenki imate u svom broju?

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.000
(Smijeh)

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.000
21. OK. Dobro. Koliko imate vi u svom?

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:40.350
18. Dakle, ide ovoj dami ovdje.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.000
21 je najbliže.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.480
Zapravo ima - broj simetrija
u Rubikovoj kocki

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.480
ima 25 znamenki.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.280
Sada trebam imenovati ovaj predmet.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:50.190
Dakle, kako se zovete?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.000
Treba mi Vaše prezime.
Simetrični predmeti najčešće -

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.000
sričite mi svoje ime.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:17:01.080
G-H-E-Z